+      `${intro} based on the available synthetic fuel data, the voyage may require a provisional greenhouse gas intensity note if the bunker stem changes before sailing. Please confirm the fuel pathway declaration expected from the supplier.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`,
+      `${intro} please keep FuelEU assumptions separate from EU ETS allowance exposure. We need the demo data to show that cost accrual and compliance intensity are related but not identical workflows.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`,
