      `${intro} please keep FuelEU assumptions separate from EU ETS allowance exposure. We need the demo data to show that cost accrual and compliance intensity are related but not identical workflows.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`,
      `${intro} supplier declaration language is acceptable for a demo file. Please include the note in the voyage pack and flag any missing lower-heating-value assumptions.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`,
      `${intro} closing this FuelEU query with a provisional compliance note. No operational hold is required for ${voyage.vessel_name}.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`
    ],
    missing_mrv_fuel_data: [
      `${intro}\n\nMRV fuel data is incomplete for ${voyage.vessel_name} / ${voyage.voyage_id}. We are missing confirmed consumption for the sailing period after ETD ${etdDate} and need the figures before closing emissions records.${attachmentLine}${signoff}`,
